<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$159.7 mln trade surplus in February.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$159.7 mln trade surplus in February.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Wednesday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for February.</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Feb 1997	    Jan 1997	     Feb 1996</p>
<p>Balance    +$159.7 mln	 -$131.5 mln	  +$50.6 mln</p>
<p>Exports     $1.67 billion     $1.46 bln	    $1.74 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.51 billion     $1.59 bln	    $1.69 bln</p>
<p>		Yr-to-Feb 1997    Yr-to-Jan 1997     Yr-to-Feb 1996</p>
<p>Balance    -$309.8 mln	 -$418.8 mln	  -$1.01 bln</p>
<p>Exports     $20.86 bln	  $20.92 bln	   $20.57 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $21.17 bln	  $21.34 bln	   $21.58 bln</p>
<p>Trend series:</p>
<p>		Feb 1997	    Jan 1997	     Feb 1996</p>
<p>Balance    +$2.0 mln	   +$8.9 mln	    -$122.6 mln</p>
<p>Exports     $1.72 billion     $1.73 bln	    $1.67 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.71 billion     $1.72 bln	    $1.79 bln</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
